WEBVTT

00:12.637 --> 00:15.432
We will now execute
a joint operation to arrest Kim

00:15.515 --> 00:17.058
and seize all firearms.

00:17.142 --> 00:21.062
While the SOU and I round up
Gu Jeong-man and Kim at the club,

00:21.146 --> 00:25.734
Officer Lee will raid the tool market
and seize all of Gu Jeong-man's guns.

00:26.484 --> 00:29.404
Can't we just send the SOU team
into the tool market

00:29.487 --> 00:31.489
to overwhelm them with numbers?

00:32.073 --> 00:34.242
There are too many risk factors.

00:34.325 --> 00:36.786
There's an apartment block,
a busy commercial district,

00:36.870 --> 00:39.581
and even a subway station
near the tool market.

00:40.749 --> 00:43.001
With public anxiety over guns at its peak,

00:43.084 --> 00:44.544
a large-scale shootout

00:45.378 --> 00:47.338
would cause widespread panic
and confusion.

00:49.257 --> 00:51.259
I'm sure you already know this,

00:51.342 --> 00:54.679
but the operation must be executed
swiftly and discreetly.

00:54.763 --> 00:57.640
But can we really trust
Gong Seok-ho to cooperate?

00:58.141 --> 01:00.435
Maybe he's up to something.

01:00.518 --> 01:01.811
We're prepared.

01:01.895 --> 01:04.856
Once I capture Gong Seok-ho
and Gu Jeong-man at the club,

01:05.356 --> 01:07.776
Officer Lee will promptly move
into the tool market.

01:08.276 --> 01:09.944
First, I'll seize Gu's firearms.

01:10.028 --> 01:12.864
Then I'll search the place
for evidence on Kim.

01:12.947 --> 01:16.284
Okay, then. Bring Kim here by tomorrow.

01:36.638 --> 01:41.101
GYEONGIN SEOBU POLICE STATION

01:46.189 --> 01:48.399
- I'm done.
- Come on, hurry up.

01:48.483 --> 01:49.818
- Did you load everything?
- Yeah.

01:52.570 --> 01:53.404
Follow them.

02:02.664 --> 02:05.375
All units, stand by in position
until Gu Jeong-man arrives.

02:27.188 --> 02:28.022
Hey, Do.

02:28.606 --> 02:30.150
We're all set.

02:30.233 --> 02:31.860
Gu Jeong-man hasn't arrived yet.

02:32.360 --> 02:33.862
I'll call you when he does.

02:34.654 --> 02:35.530
YAKAM TOURIST HOTEL

02:36.656 --> 02:39.409
Damn it.
What's taking those bastards so long?

02:50.170 --> 02:51.880
Your fingers are fine, right?

02:53.089 --> 02:54.090
Of course.

02:54.674 --> 02:57.010
I even used hand cream to keep them soft.

02:57.510 --> 03:00.805
Put that on and go have
that long-overdue talk with Gong.

03:01.472 --> 03:02.765
And send him my regards.

03:03.349 --> 03:04.684
Sure, I'll pass it on.

03:05.393 --> 03:06.227
For sure.

03:40.511 --> 03:42.305
What the fuck was that?

03:42.388 --> 03:43.264
Hey.

03:45.183 --> 03:46.434
How do you like my tool?

03:47.727 --> 03:48.728
Dope, isn't it?

03:54.692 --> 03:55.777
Wait.

03:55.860 --> 03:58.696
Hold on, Jeong-man! Just hear me out!

03:59.280 --> 04:00.281
No!

04:34.274 --> 04:36.567
Gu Jeong-man's vehicle is approaching.

04:37.819 --> 04:38.695
He's here.

04:39.904 --> 04:43.533
Everyone, check your guns
and bulletproof vests. Stay alert.

04:50.248 --> 04:51.249
You good?

04:55.920 --> 04:58.881
If I make it out alive,

05:00.591 --> 05:01.968
I'll treat you to a feast.

05:02.593 --> 05:03.553
And if you don't?

05:03.636 --> 05:04.762
If I don't?

05:07.140 --> 05:09.392
Ask Jeong-man to treat you. I'm off.

05:13.062 --> 05:14.063
Later.

05:31.247 --> 05:32.915
Hey, come in.

05:42.759 --> 05:43.760
Good to see you.

05:43.843 --> 05:45.553
Gong, you fucking bitch.

05:47.305 --> 05:49.974
You asked for my fingers, didn't you?
Here they are. Bye!

05:53.936 --> 05:54.771
Fucking hell.

05:54.854 --> 05:56.689
You backstabbed me,

05:57.190 --> 05:58.858
and Jeong-man backstabbed you.

05:58.941 --> 06:00.902
Isn't this hilarious? Right?

06:04.113 --> 06:05.865
Shots fired in the building.

06:06.908 --> 06:08.743
SOU team, move in first.

06:08.826 --> 06:11.788
Sweep the building in teams of two,
starting from the first floor.

06:21.172 --> 06:23.883
You fucking son of a bitch!

06:23.966 --> 06:27.178
Fucking hell, you scared me!
Why are you yelling at me?

06:27.678 --> 06:28.513
Sir.

06:29.597 --> 06:31.057
Got those fingers you wanted?

06:32.350 --> 06:33.351
Where are you?

06:33.434 --> 06:35.144
That's not important right now.

06:35.728 --> 06:38.356
Did you meet Mr. Kim?

06:40.400 --> 06:42.735
I have no idea
about this cash cow or whatever,

06:44.570 --> 06:47.865
but consider this payback
for the money you stole from our work.

06:48.449 --> 06:49.283
What?

06:49.367 --> 06:50.743
Oh, and I'm sorry.

06:50.827 --> 06:53.454
You know those cigars? The Cubans.

06:55.331 --> 06:58.042
To be honest,
they don't fucking suit you at all.

06:59.001 --> 07:00.002
Gu Jeong-man.

07:01.045 --> 07:03.172
How dare you stab me in the back.

07:09.011 --> 07:11.639
You told me to trust you,
then called the cops on me.

07:12.140 --> 07:14.600
Damn you, motherfucker!

07:36.497 --> 07:37.415
Let's go.

07:40.877 --> 07:41.878
Fuck--

07:47.758 --> 07:50.553
Stop shooting, for fuck's sake.

07:53.347 --> 07:56.309
Let's die here together, motherfucker.

08:23.544 --> 08:25.463
What? This is not Gu Jeong-man.

08:26.255 --> 08:27.632
It's Kim.

08:29.467 --> 08:32.345
What are you saying?
Then where's Gu Jeong-man?

08:32.970 --> 08:35.473
He's probably heading your way,
don't you think?

08:36.057 --> 08:37.183
Okay. I'll check.

09:08.589 --> 09:09.715
Wait for my signal.

09:10.633 --> 09:11.759
Stand by for the signal.

09:27.400 --> 09:29.110
Jeong-man, how'd it go?

09:29.193 --> 09:30.152
Gather around.

09:35.616 --> 09:37.618
Holy shit! Jeong-man, what's all this?

09:37.702 --> 09:41.747
Boys, this is your severance pay.
Split it evenly among yourselves.

09:41.831 --> 09:45.167
Let's live it up like everyone else
and suit up!

09:48.087 --> 09:49.005
This is awesome!

09:51.465 --> 09:54.051
Hey, there's one more!

09:54.135 --> 09:55.595
Come on, grab your share too.

09:55.678 --> 09:56.512
- You punk.
- Okay.

09:58.222 --> 10:00.141
- It's not safe. Leave now!
- Okay.

10:21.912 --> 10:22.747
Hey, Jeong-man.

10:23.706 --> 10:25.583
The cops totally stormed in.

10:26.417 --> 10:27.251
Okay.

10:28.544 --> 10:29.670
Get over here fast.

11:01.243 --> 11:02.411
Hey, got a light?

11:02.495 --> 11:04.997
- A light? Nah.
- I'll grab one from the car.

11:21.931 --> 11:24.266
- Seung-gyeong. Go check.
- Shit, are the cops here?

11:25.142 --> 11:28.229
Suspect engaged. Moving in.
Everyone else, join when the SOU arrives.

11:30.815 --> 11:31.857
Hey, grab these!

11:32.358 --> 11:33.818
- Hey, the bag!
- Bring it!

11:34.318 --> 11:35.820
- In here.
- Put it in.

11:35.903 --> 11:37.321
Open the bag and throw it in!

12:05.558 --> 12:07.977
Fuck.

12:28.372 --> 12:29.290
Go!

12:57.902 --> 13:00.529
Shots fired at a tool market.

13:00.613 --> 13:02.531
Eliminate all suspects on sight.

13:05.659 --> 13:06.660
Step on it!

13:07.953 --> 13:09.330
- Hurry!
- All right!

13:28.224 --> 13:29.225
Chang-ju.

13:29.725 --> 13:30.726
You all right?

13:32.228 --> 13:33.062
Chang-ju!

13:33.854 --> 13:34.855
Chang-ju!

13:44.114 --> 13:44.990
Jun-ho.

13:45.491 --> 13:46.325
Hey, Jun-ho!

13:46.408 --> 13:47.368
We need to go.

13:47.868 --> 13:48.702
Get up!

13:57.378 --> 13:59.129
Come on, Jun-ho.

14:00.172 --> 14:01.006
Get up.

14:28.826 --> 14:31.537
Gu Jeong-man's location confirmed.
Proceeding with arrest.

14:51.974 --> 14:55.352
All firearms used in recent shootings

14:55.436 --> 14:58.439
have been traced
to the gang arrested today.

14:59.148 --> 15:01.984
The police stated
they would make every effort

15:02.067 --> 15:04.069
to find the remaining unrecovered guns.

15:04.904 --> 15:08.365
The police who dismantled
the illegal firearms network…

15:09.158 --> 15:12.578
Come on. Is this seriously how it ends?

16:17.059 --> 16:18.060
Would you like to

16:19.103 --> 16:20.104
see for yourself?

16:43.669 --> 16:44.795
This is

16:45.629 --> 16:46.755
your daughter, right?

16:49.633 --> 16:50.467
That's…

16:58.308 --> 16:59.560
That's not my daughter.

17:01.186 --> 17:02.271
Pardon?

17:02.980 --> 17:04.606
I said that's not my daughter.

17:05.983 --> 17:07.276
I know this is hard,

17:08.861 --> 17:10.738
but please take a closer look.

17:32.885 --> 17:34.678
That's not my daughter.

17:58.077 --> 18:01.955
MY DAUGHTER

18:04.958 --> 18:05.876
Please.

18:07.711 --> 18:09.963
Pick up just once. Please.

18:10.047 --> 18:14.551
My daughter packed another bland lunch,
even though no one asked her to.

18:14.635 --> 18:15.928
It's healthy food.

18:16.011 --> 18:17.429
Make sure to eat it all.

18:17.513 --> 18:18.722
All right.

18:19.556 --> 18:21.475
She's insisting on moving out now.

18:21.558 --> 18:23.936
She says work-life balance
is important or something.

18:24.019 --> 18:27.356
Why does she have to get a loan
just to get a jeonse and move out?

18:27.439 --> 18:29.900
- For crying out loud.
- Who do we have here?

18:30.400 --> 18:32.903
Goodness, it's my daughter.
My dear Se-yeong.

18:32.986 --> 18:34.530
I told you to check properly.

18:34.613 --> 18:36.824
I checked and called,
but I can't reach them.

18:36.907 --> 18:38.742
That's why I came to you for help.

18:38.826 --> 18:40.828
- You think the police are PIs?
- Whatever.

18:44.498 --> 18:45.499
Se-yeong,

18:46.792 --> 18:48.460
please pick up my call once.

19:18.031 --> 19:20.159
Yeah, okay. All right.

19:20.242 --> 19:22.452
- Good evening, Inspector.
- What brings you here?

19:22.536 --> 19:24.913
- I just need to check something.
- I see.

19:38.427 --> 19:40.804
Things are crazy
because of guns these days.

19:40.888 --> 19:44.016
- You take care, too, okay?
- I will. Thank you.

19:46.894 --> 19:48.228
You take care as well.

19:48.312 --> 19:49.688
- I'll be in touch.
- Sure.

19:50.189 --> 19:51.523
- Be careful.
- Thanks!

20:06.747 --> 20:07.789
How can I help you?

20:13.295 --> 20:15.547
My goodness, Sergeant Lee.

20:16.840 --> 20:17.716
Long time no see.

20:18.342 --> 20:20.886
- You're still alive, then?
- How have you been?

20:23.096 --> 20:26.892
Hey, by the way,
don't you think you're too harsh?

20:27.893 --> 20:31.855
After all our time on the battlefield,
you only show up when you need something.

20:31.939 --> 20:33.398
It hurts me, you know.

20:37.486 --> 20:39.029
Sorry, I didn't mean to.

20:40.739 --> 20:44.243
If you feel that bad,
at least treat me to a meal first.

20:44.326 --> 20:46.578
Forget it.
I know you're not the type to do that.

20:46.662 --> 20:47.496
Let's see.

20:50.249 --> 20:51.541
Wow, what's this?

20:53.126 --> 20:55.379
It was found
in the gun recovered from the scene.

20:56.505 --> 20:58.882
Wow, this is a state-of-the-art GPS!

20:59.383 --> 21:02.386
Man, this is dope.
It even has wiretapping features.

21:05.347 --> 21:07.099
So is it wiretapping us now?

21:08.267 --> 21:09.101
No.

21:10.060 --> 21:13.438
This chip alone
supports only GPS tracking.

21:14.439 --> 21:16.692
Wait, were there any other devices?

21:19.611 --> 21:22.364
Other devices… I don't think so.

21:23.198 --> 21:24.449
So, with this device,

21:25.200 --> 21:27.911
you can only track locations.

21:27.995 --> 21:30.914
You need an external device
to enable wiretapping.

21:34.084 --> 21:35.460
"An external device"?

21:36.336 --> 21:37.546
Well, think it over.

21:38.130 --> 21:41.049
There must have been
something more to each gun.

21:55.772 --> 21:58.608
In recent years,
a massive influx of illegal firearms

21:58.692 --> 22:01.903
has been observed in areas
affected by civil and interstate wars.

22:01.987 --> 22:05.324
A CIA investigation
traced the series of incidents

22:06.742 --> 22:10.954
back to the International Rifle Union,
also known as IRU.

22:11.038 --> 22:13.874
Operating primarily in the black market,

22:14.374 --> 22:18.170
it is a vast organization
that illegally supplies weapons

22:18.253 --> 22:22.257
to countries or groups
that cannot acquire them legally.

22:23.008 --> 22:26.678
Additionally, they are known
to wield immense influence,

22:26.762 --> 22:30.766
extensively lobbying US politicians
and multinational corporations

22:30.849 --> 22:32.351
and making them nearly untouchable.

22:33.977 --> 22:35.270
This is Blue Brown.

22:35.896 --> 22:37.314
He has been identified

22:37.814 --> 22:41.777
as the key figure overseeing and managing
all aspects of firearm distribution

22:41.860 --> 22:43.737
currently occurring in South Korea.

22:43.820 --> 22:45.697
How many firearms are in the country now?

22:46.656 --> 22:48.992
The current estimate
is around 30,000 firearms.

22:49.659 --> 22:51.912
What? Did you just say 30,000?

22:51.995 --> 22:54.247
It was revealed
that no courier services were used

22:54.331 --> 22:56.333
in the Yu and Jeon incidents.

22:57.167 --> 23:01.421
We're working to trace where and how
these firearms were stored and moved,

23:01.505 --> 23:03.507
but it's proving difficult.

23:05.175 --> 23:07.886
If they smuggle them in
and don't use couriers,

23:09.179 --> 23:12.391
how do they distribute so many firearms
across the country?

23:33.495 --> 23:35.455
So this is where you were hiding.

23:39.126 --> 23:39.960
Hey!

23:40.502 --> 23:42.796
How dare you leave the station
without permission!

23:45.006 --> 23:46.007
I'm sorry.

23:46.716 --> 23:48.218
My shift is over,

23:49.719 --> 23:52.514
and I haven't been home all week.

23:53.056 --> 23:54.850
I just wanted to grab some clean socks.

23:57.185 --> 23:58.979
Just wash them and put them back on.

23:59.563 --> 24:01.481
Are you a complete idiot?

24:02.357 --> 24:04.401
I just got chewed out because of you.

24:05.026 --> 24:08.864
Go wipe down all the IV poles
and dressing trolleys now.

24:09.573 --> 24:13.076
I swear, everything you do
just pisses me off.

24:14.035 --> 24:16.830
If your brain's not working,
at least use your body!

24:16.913 --> 24:19.875
Come on, Nurse Yu-jin!
Let's just go, okay?

24:20.709 --> 24:21.543
Fucking bitch.

24:22.294 --> 24:24.004
Just seeing her pisses me off.

24:24.087 --> 24:25.547
I can't stand her.

25:08.131 --> 25:08.965
Hey.

25:13.720 --> 25:16.806
What would happen
if everyone in Korea had a gun?

25:17.849 --> 25:18.683
Sorry?

25:19.643 --> 25:20.852
Aren't you curious?

25:21.645 --> 25:24.105
I'm not sure what you mean…

25:28.318 --> 25:31.821
In the end,
what angers and humiliates people the most

25:32.822 --> 25:33.907
is other people.

25:34.699 --> 25:36.743
Selfish, disrespectful people.

25:38.411 --> 25:40.163
But strangely, when you have a gun,

25:41.540 --> 25:42.791
they act differently.

25:44.334 --> 25:45.252
Are you saying

25:47.003 --> 25:50.215
you would like to change the world
with guns?

25:51.758 --> 25:53.343
Realistically, that's impossible…

25:59.558 --> 26:01.685
Do you know the true power of a gun?

26:03.645 --> 26:05.188
All I'm doing

26:05.981 --> 26:08.984
is pulling this five-millimeter trigger,

26:10.902 --> 26:13.989
yet the sound of the gun
would quickly spread over 500 meters,

26:14.739 --> 26:17.200
striking fear into people's hearts.

26:19.578 --> 26:21.121
And in one way or another,

26:22.163 --> 26:24.124
it provokes a reaction from them.

26:24.833 --> 26:26.918
But what if it wasn't one person

26:28.003 --> 26:30.130
but a hundred pulling the trigger?

26:34.926 --> 26:36.177
Or a thousand people?

26:38.430 --> 26:39.806
Or ten thousand?

26:42.309 --> 26:44.978
In the blink of an eye.

26:47.522 --> 26:49.733
And eventually, that fear

26:50.817 --> 26:52.611
will lead to a new order.

27:05.832 --> 27:09.794
To influence Koreans
who are easily swayed by emotions,

27:09.878 --> 27:12.339
those with a tragic backstory

27:13.423 --> 27:15.759
must be the first to pull the trigger.

27:16.801 --> 27:18.928
So everyone can empathize
with their anger.

27:20.639 --> 27:23.725
So you have only one job.

27:25.518 --> 27:27.354
Get some good footage

27:28.313 --> 27:29.731
so people can witness

27:30.607 --> 27:31.858
the power of a gun.

27:34.694 --> 27:37.739
Who exactly are you people?

27:42.243 --> 27:45.330
Who we are, you and I, isn't important.

27:48.291 --> 27:50.585
What's important is what I do from now on.

27:53.338 --> 27:58.218
That will completely change
the world as we know it.

28:09.979 --> 28:11.606
If my guess is right,

28:12.941 --> 28:15.819
every gun should have a chip like this.

28:15.902 --> 28:18.571
That's how they can monitor
those who have them.

28:21.449 --> 28:22.909
In that case,

28:24.202 --> 28:26.287
what could that external device be?

28:34.462 --> 28:35.839
- Hey, Do.
- Hey, it's me.

28:36.464 --> 28:40.135
Was the address list the only common link
between the shooters?

28:41.177 --> 28:44.514
Nothing else
except their cell phones being hacked.

28:44.597 --> 28:45.432
Cell phones…

28:53.857 --> 28:57.569
Sir, this is Officer Lee Do.
He was my superior in the military.

28:59.904 --> 29:00.780
Officer Lee.

29:00.864 --> 29:03.700
Once the IRU selects a target area,

29:04.200 --> 29:07.370
they leave bullets behind
to mark the start of their operation.

29:07.871 --> 29:10.957
It's a signal for them to distribute guns
and devastate the region.

29:11.040 --> 29:11.875
Do.

29:13.042 --> 29:14.794
Before the gosiwon shooting,

29:14.878 --> 29:17.380
bullets were left
at a nearby rooftop house.

29:17.964 --> 29:19.716
You remember that case, don't you?

29:20.216 --> 29:21.301
Detective Seo!

29:25.013 --> 29:26.598
He had this on his body?

29:26.681 --> 29:28.558
Obviously, these must not be registered.

29:29.142 --> 29:30.685
What was the deceased's job?

29:30.769 --> 29:32.562
The deceased had a criminal record.

29:32.645 --> 29:35.732
Apparently,
he sold children left in a baby box

29:35.815 --> 29:38.401
to foreign brokers 20 to 30 years ago.

29:43.281 --> 29:44.157
Who are you?

29:44.783 --> 29:45.867
Long time no see.

29:48.077 --> 29:48.912
What?

29:49.829 --> 29:50.830
Hey.

29:51.581 --> 29:52.916
I asked who you were!

29:59.380 --> 30:00.632
You haven't changed a bit.

30:02.550 --> 30:04.844
Let's make some money.

30:04.928 --> 30:07.722
Let's see. Blood type AB…

30:08.389 --> 30:09.224
Hey!

30:10.183 --> 30:11.184
Yeah, you.

30:11.726 --> 30:12.560
Come out here.

30:13.478 --> 30:14.562
Come on.

30:21.110 --> 30:25.031
So the bullets you found
in the rooftop house were his signal

30:25.114 --> 30:28.785
that he would devastate
the country that abandoned him.

30:34.707 --> 30:37.377
He's determined to convey his intentions
by any means.

30:37.877 --> 30:41.422
There must be a reason
he approached you, Officer Lee.

30:43.633 --> 30:45.176
I'm not sure about that…

30:49.764 --> 30:52.058
but this was found
in a gun from Gu's gang.

30:53.518 --> 30:56.938
GPS devices like this were hidden
in all distributed guns.

30:58.398 --> 31:01.150
So they used these chips
to track who they gave the guns to?

31:01.234 --> 31:02.235
That's my guess.

31:02.318 --> 31:04.529
It's a state-of-the-art GPS
that can monitor

31:05.029 --> 31:07.907
and wiretap when used
with an activated external device.

31:08.908 --> 31:11.452
I was thinking
we could trace these devices back.

31:11.536 --> 31:12.620
Trace them back?

31:12.704 --> 31:15.582
As you may know,
a common signal might show up

31:15.665 --> 31:18.418
if we check the chips
in the confiscated guns.

31:18.501 --> 31:22.130
The source of that signal
could be the organization's base.

31:23.506 --> 31:24.757
That's a possibility.

31:25.508 --> 31:27.093
Huh? What's going on?

31:27.176 --> 31:28.553
- Huh?
- What is that?

31:29.596 --> 31:31.180
- What's all this?
- Check the screen!

31:31.264 --> 31:32.724
- It's Blue Brown!
- What?

31:33.308 --> 31:34.767
Server team, check!

31:34.851 --> 31:36.394
- Control's not working.
- Yes, sir.

31:36.477 --> 31:38.354
- Trace the hacking route.
- Yes, sir.

31:38.438 --> 31:39.898
Check the server.

31:39.981 --> 31:40.899
Yes, will do.

31:40.982 --> 31:43.985
- It's not working.
- Too many phone users to narrow down.

31:46.237 --> 31:47.739
Determining the location now.

31:51.868 --> 31:54.954
Sir, it looks like someone in here
has a gun.

31:55.038 --> 31:57.916
Now put your hands on your head
and stand up immediately.

31:58.416 --> 31:59.500
Get up now!

32:00.543 --> 32:02.045
Move to the back of the room.

32:02.670 --> 32:04.797
- Don't touch anything.
- Hands on your head.

32:06.174 --> 32:07.926
Now move toward the wall.

32:08.009 --> 32:09.093
Well?

32:10.511 --> 32:12.472
Aren't you happy to see me again?

32:14.140 --> 32:16.476
Well, I was sure

32:17.477 --> 32:19.312
you'd find those chips quickly.

32:21.606 --> 32:22.607
But

32:24.025 --> 32:26.527
that's not what's important right now.

32:29.948 --> 32:30.782
One gun confirmed.

32:33.368 --> 32:34.285
That gun…

32:37.121 --> 32:38.998
Do you think it's the only one?

32:40.583 --> 32:43.461
There are many people in Korea
who want guns.

32:43.962 --> 32:46.297
Here, there, everywhere.

32:48.299 --> 32:49.634
And at 27 Baekju-ro…

32:51.678 --> 32:52.720
27 Baekju-ro.

32:54.472 --> 32:56.975
There's someone about to pull the trigger.

32:58.267 --> 32:59.268
This is 27 Baekju-ro.

32:59.352 --> 33:00.353
I'm just curious

33:01.145 --> 33:03.106
to see what you decide to do.

33:08.361 --> 33:09.362
Decide quickly.

33:11.280 --> 33:13.366
There isn't much time left.

33:20.707 --> 33:21.666
Captain.

33:23.209 --> 33:28.506
Another victim of a jeonse scam
took their own life this morning.

33:29.424 --> 33:32.176
This is already the ninth reported case.

33:32.969 --> 33:35.430
Despite the victims' pleas of desperation,

33:35.513 --> 33:40.059
the authorities are being criticized
for only introducing unrealistic measures.

33:40.935 --> 33:44.897
Victims are demanding harsher penalties
for scammers from the government.

33:44.981 --> 33:45.982
to protect victims…

34:08.921 --> 34:09.881
Captain.

34:43.998 --> 34:44.832
Do.

34:46.542 --> 34:47.543
Do!

34:57.261 --> 34:59.472
- Track the location of this GPS chip.
- Yes, sir.

35:09.190 --> 35:10.858
This is where the GPS got picked up.

35:10.942 --> 35:13.111
- Update me on Blue Brown's location.
- Yes, sir.

35:13.194 --> 35:14.278
Okay, let's go!

35:28.334 --> 35:31.045
CAPTAIN JO

35:53.359 --> 35:55.820
Hey! Let's get wasted!

35:58.364 --> 35:59.532
CANCEL

36:14.547 --> 36:15.923
Got Blue Brown's location?

36:16.591 --> 36:19.719
Blue Brown is in the MS Building
underground parking lot.

36:48.164 --> 36:51.459
- We're not interested.
- Who called a trot singer?

37:24.367 --> 37:25.201
Damn it.

37:26.535 --> 37:28.955
Hey, Do. Se-yeong fell victim

37:29.705 --> 37:31.916
to a jeonse scam, and she…

37:35.461 --> 37:36.587
Do any of you know…

37:38.756 --> 37:40.091
what pain feels like?

37:40.174 --> 37:41.008
- Pain?
- So random.

37:41.092 --> 37:42.927
- Lost your mind?
- Is that the title?

37:43.010 --> 37:44.595
- What the fuck?
- "Pain"?

37:44.679 --> 37:48.516
Why the hell would you enter our room
and say this bullshit?

37:48.599 --> 37:49.600
Hey, piss off.

37:49.684 --> 37:52.687
Seriously, what's this fucking lunatic
talking about?

37:53.354 --> 37:55.022
Get him out of here already.

37:55.940 --> 37:58.317
Son Hyeon-seong, 34 years old.

37:58.401 --> 38:01.279
Seven convictions,
including fraud and illegal gambling.

38:03.281 --> 38:05.741
Cheon Il-su, 35 years old.

38:05.825 --> 38:08.286
Nine convictions,
including fraud and assault.

38:12.790 --> 38:13.624
What the fuck?

38:16.252 --> 38:18.337
You're killing my damn buzz.

38:19.880 --> 38:21.048
Who are you, old man?

38:27.096 --> 38:29.640
Because of people like you,

38:30.349 --> 38:33.436
who feel no guilt leeching off
hardworking, ordinary people…

38:40.860 --> 38:42.236
my precious daughter…

38:44.572 --> 38:46.490
and another innocent person

38:46.991 --> 38:48.701
took their own lives today.

38:49.327 --> 38:51.912
What the hell does your daughter's death

38:52.747 --> 38:54.415
have to do with us?

38:57.752 --> 39:00.212
I came here
after identifying my daughter's body.

39:03.049 --> 39:05.551
Don't you dare insult my daughter's death.

39:06.886 --> 39:09.889
What are you waiting for?
Get this old man's mug out of here.

39:09.972 --> 39:12.475
So what? Huh?

39:12.975 --> 39:14.643
What do you want? Did we kill her?

39:14.727 --> 39:16.520
No, we didn't kill her. Fuck.

39:16.604 --> 39:18.731
So why the hell
are you crashing our party?

39:18.814 --> 39:21.025
What the fuck do you want us to do?

39:21.108 --> 39:22.860
What do you want from us?

39:23.694 --> 39:26.113
Apologize at my daughter's funeral.

39:26.697 --> 39:28.949
Apologize? Apologize, my ass.

39:29.575 --> 39:31.702
Did your daughter ask you to do this?

39:32.536 --> 39:35.289
Unless you wanna join your daughter
in the morgue,

39:35.956 --> 39:38.793
just shut the fuck up
and piss off, motherfucker.

39:39.752 --> 39:40.795
I said piss off.

39:42.254 --> 39:43.381
Piss off already.

39:43.464 --> 39:44.465
Piss off now.

39:45.883 --> 39:47.051
- Now.
- Who's the old guy?

39:47.134 --> 39:48.886
- Don't fucking mind it.
- Piss off.

39:48.969 --> 39:50.304
- It's pissing me off.
- Hey!

39:50.388 --> 39:51.222
Hey!

39:57.228 --> 39:58.729
Where the fuck are you going?

40:01.899 --> 40:04.110
What the fuck? That bastard is crazy!

40:04.735 --> 40:06.320
Someone died…

40:06.404 --> 40:07.780
Hey, don't shoot! Fuck!

40:07.863 --> 40:10.199
…yet you people don't feel any guilt.

40:12.451 --> 40:14.578
There is no hope left for you.

40:15.371 --> 40:17.164
You, outside! Call the police!

44:14.068 --> 44:19.073
Subtitle translation by: Sung In Jang
